<title>FRANCE: Eritrean foreign minister arrives in Algiers.</title>
<headline>Eritrean foreign minister arrives in Algiers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eritrean Foreign Minister Petros Solomon arrived on Sunday on an official visit to Algeria to boost cooperation between the two countries, the Algerian official news agency APS said.</p>
<p>Petros, accompanied by a large delegation, was greeted by his Algerian counterpart Ahmed Attaf, said APS.</p>
</text>
